"Agent 灵动岛 · 接入与验证" = "Agent Island · Connect & Verify";
"让 Agent 状态，在这里汇合" = "All your agents' status, in one place";
"Alpha · 本地状态层，不是任务调度器" = "Alpha · A local status layer, not a task scheduler";
"忙时收成小态，需要你时轻轻展开。当前只观察状态；批准、停止和回复仍在原应用完成。" = "It stays small while agents work and opens up when one needs you. For now it only observes: approving, stopping and replying still happen in each agent's own app.";
"1 · 选择接入，知情安装" = "1 · Choose what to connect";
"无需 API Key 或 Python。仅合并所选本地 Hook 配置，保留其他设置，并生成备份。" = "No API key or Python needed. It only merges the local hook config for the agents you pick, keeps every other setting, and makes a backup first.";
