"安装所选状态观察器？" = "Connect the selected agents?";
"以上配置先备份再合并。接入使用固定桥接入口；后续灵动岛升级会原子更新桥接，保留旧版用于回退，已运行的回调不中断。保留其他设置和已有审批选择，不新增信任或审批权限，不启动任务。卸载不删除历史。安装前请暂时关闭会编辑这些配置的原应用。" = "Each file above is backed up before it's merged. The connection goes through a fixed bridge; future updates replace the bridge atomically, keep the old one for rollback, and don't interrupt events already in flight. Your other settings and approval choices stay as they are; no new trust or approval permissions are added and no tasks are started. Disconnecting doesn't delete history. Before connecting, quit any app that edits these files.";
